    check the current URL, capture a screenshot of the Sign-In page, and verify that the MoneyWise logo is present in the correct position.

2.) Verify that after successfully signing up, the application navigates directly to the Sign-In page.

Signin module 
------------

3.) Verify that after entering valid credentials (username and password) on the Sign-In page and clicking the Sign-In button,
    the MoneyWise Dashboard is displayed. Capture a screenshot of the Dashboard page.
    
income module 
-------------
